[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 542.959, "timestamp": "00:09:02", "text": "好的。 我的天啊。那是寿司。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.389, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "你的Discord账号是什么？呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 555.11, "timestamp": "00:09:15", "text": "你不需要发送作品集。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.23, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "实际上，你不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 560.71, "timestamp": "00:09:20", "text": "你不需要说“我做不到，我不会”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 569.43, "timestamp": "00:09:29", "text": "不，你不需要发送加入和点赞信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 573.19, "timestamp": "00:09:33", "text": "我又一次踢了GFS的球。所以如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 574.87, "timestamp": "00:09:34", "text": "一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 577.35, "timestamp": "00:09:37", "text": "呃，你还不如被踢出去呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 579.11, "timestamp": "00:09:39", "text": "再说一遍，不要自我推销。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 582.55, "timestamp": "00:09:42", "text": "顺便说一句，约翰，这违反了规定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 589.75, "timestamp": "00:09:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.389, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "大家好，我是寿星。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 598.87, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "text": "大家好，我是今天的寿星。"}]